      "data": {
        "text": "**Choosing Logging Provider**\n\nI've decided to move forward with Google Cloud Logging as the external logging provider. I'll be implementing the Google Cloud Logging client library within the `query_error_logs.py` script. The goal is to make the external logging provider very clear in the Python code.\n\n\n**Implementing Logging Provider**\n\nI'm now in the process of implementing Google Cloud Logging within `query_error_logs.py`. The plan is to ensure the use of the Google Cloud Logging client library is obvious. I'm focusing on writing the code to effectively query error logs using this library. The next step will be to make the chosen logging provider highly visible within the code.\n\n\n",
        "time": {
          "end": 1789818401263,
          "start": 1789818397273
        },
        "type": "reasoning"
      },
      "id": "prt_0b97d6259001KizCemYqZ6iZ64",
