      "data": {
        "text": "**Choosing Cloud Logging**\n\nOkay, I've decided to use Google Cloud Logging as the external provider. This seems like a solid choice for the `write_correlated_logs.py` file, as it offers scalability and integration with other Google Cloud services. I'm focusing on how I'll structure the logging events to include the correlation ID.\n\n\n**Defining Logging Provider**\n\nI've selected Google Cloud Logging for the `write_correlated_logs.py` file, prioritizing its scalability and integration. Now I'm actively structuring logging events to ensure each includes the all-important correlation ID. The file creation and initial setup is also in progress.\n\n\n",
